Defect Atlas includes a deterministic subset of 88 VisA photographs from candle
and pcb1, plus 40 ground-truth annotation masks. Photographs were resized,
converted to sRGB JPEG and stripped of metadata. Masks were recoloured as
transparent overlays and resized by nearest neighbour. Source images, labels,
mask classes and hashes are traced in src/data/dataset-manifest.json. Some
article/social artwork may contain a resized VisA photograph with a separate
application diagram; that diagram is not dataset ground truth or an AI heatmap.

